OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIsolated showers first thing on
OL,6,FFriday morning, but these will soon
OL,7,Ffade as a ridge of high pressure
OL,8,Fbuilds in. This leaves brighter spells
OL,9,Fin the afternoon, especially in the
OL,10,Fwest. Light winds and temperatures
OL,11,Fnear average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry with clear spells
OL,14,Finitially. However, it will cloud over
OL,15,Ffrom the west after midnight, with
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain arriving.
OL,17,FStrengthening southwesterly winds,
OL,18,Fwith risk of coastal gales by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
