OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cloudy and wet start
OL,6,FSaturday morning with heavier bursts
OL,7,Fover the hills. Becoming drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter into the afternoon as the
OL,9,Frain clears slowly to the south.
OL,10,FRemaining windy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,13,Fwith variable amounts of cloud around
OL,14,Fon Sunday before another area of rain
OL,15,Farrives from the west for Monday.
OL,16,FTurning rather showery on Tuesday,
OL,17,Fwith a risk of thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
